Parked until stacks/netbird has run once (2026-11-03).

The stack's .env reads its setup key from OpenBao
(secrets/third-party-tokens/netbird/setup-keys#/gateway-<cluster>), which
stacks/netbird creates. That stack waits on stacks/netbird-edge, so until both
have applied the reference cannot resolve, and every Dockge site stack (home,
ocracoke, gulf-of-mexico) fails before deploying anything.

Delete this file once `secrets/third-party-tokens/netbird/setup-keys` exists.
